  "boundary": "Executable in the gateway: tengu_shell_set_cwd and tengu_shell_allow_rules_at_init (pure builders executed above). Boundaries: tengu_cli_flags (flags = sorted commander options with source \"cli\"; the Desktop spawn argument list is conditional and not pinned here), tengu_uds_startup_bind (durationMs/bound come from a real inbox bind), tengu_concurrent_sessions (num_sessions counted from other live sessions, only >= 2), tengu_session_start (only on session-id change), tengu_startup_perf (0.5% random sample or CLAUDE_CODE_PROFILE_STARTUP, measured spans), tengu_ripgrep_availability (first native ripgrep invocation through Ree/testOnFirstUse), tengu_event_loop_stall (periodic stall detector samples), tengu_retention_sweep (real storage sweep counters), tengu_push_reachability (server notification preferences payload), tengu_rotunda_pennant_strip (400 attributed to a server-side fallback beta header; retry path), tengu_prompt_suggestion_init (source depends on the unpinned tengu_chomp_inflection gate: growthbook vs non_interactive), tengu_prompt_suggestion (prompt-suggestion generation outcome)."
